.
.  Generate sample output for Binomial PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na binpdf.jpg
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 100 75
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE DISPLACEMENT 3
TITLE Binomial PDF (N=100, P=0.3)
TITLE SIZE 4
LABEL SIZE 4
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability Mass
X1LABEL X
LINE BLANK
SPIKE ON
XTIC OFFSET 1 1
TIC LABEL SIZE 4
Y1LABEL DISPLACEMENT 13
FRAME CORNER COORDINATES 20 20 90 90
THICKNESS 0.2
.
PLOT BINPDF(X,0.3,100) FOR X = 0 1 100
.
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
system mv binpdf.jpg ../gif100/binpdf.jpg
.
quit
